   "title": "Food sticks SECONDS after the swallow, behind the sternum: SOLIDS only, or SOLIDS + LIQUIDS?",
   "lines": [
    "can't START the swallow, coughing, choking, nasal regurgitation → OROPHARYNGEAL, not this chart",
    "ask: where it sticks · progressive or intermittent · heartburn · weight loss, hematemesis, anemia"
   ]
  },
